be[Bm7]bemos hoy, [E7]Señor.[A][Bm][A]

3. [D]Te ala[Em7]bamos con [D]gozo,
oh [Em]Se[A7]ñor;[D][G][D]
[Em7]te ala[D]ba[Dmaj7]mos
